# Cargo tool inventory — crates that are NOT available as Homebrew formulae.
# Installed by _install/cargo-tools.sh via `cargo binstall` (prebuilt binary,
# no compile) with a `cargo install` fallback.
#
# Line forms:
#   crate                                  track the latest crates.io release
#   crate@1.2.3                            pin a crates.io version
#   crate git=<url> rev=<sha>              build from a pinned git commit
#
# A git source MUST carry rev=. A branch or tag would install different code on
# different days, which is what this file exists to prevent. Git entries always
# build from source — binstall serves crates.io artifacts, not arbitrary
# revisions — and `--update` deliberately skips them: bump the pin instead.
#
# Install: just cargo-tools        Update: just cargo-tools-update
# Drift:   just cargo-dump         (compares against `cargo install --list`)
#
# BEFORE ADDING: check `brew info <name>` first. Everything that exists in
# Homebrew belongs in brew/Brewfile.* instead, so `brew bundle cleanup` sees it.

# Multi-account manager for Claude Code (profiles, usage limits, herdr plugin).
# https://github.com/uwuclxdy/clauth
#
# Pinned to a git commit, not the crates.io release: the published 0.14.1 does
# NOT contain the herdr subcommand or its plugin — the string "herdr" does not
# appear in that binary at all — while the `mommy` branch carries both under
# the same version number. The herdr integration is the reason this is
# installed, so the branch is the only usable source today. Revisit when a
# crates.io release ships the plugin.
#
# Pin moved eb6cbb8 -> 85d28a1 (tag v0.15.1) on 2026-09-05, to get off the
# refresh-token race that was signing Claude Code out (upstream #52). Carries
# b71a2d8 (publish the credential link by rename, never unlink first),
# 7f7fc36 (bound a session start's rotation-lock wait) and fa5f4ed (stop a
# rotation re-stamping a cleared rolling token) — the last one is why the
# rolling token needs this version and not the old pin. Verified before the
# bump that the herdr subcommand and herdr-plugin/ still exist at this tag.
#
# Pin moved 85d28a1 -> df5410c (mommy, past v0.17.0) on 2026-10-25. Carries the
# fix for #81 (deletes only Keychain items in its own ownership ledger — v0.15.2
# deleted foreign ones, incl. T3 Code's per-config-dir logins; never pin it),
# the divergence-banner fix (#104/#105, mommy only, not in v0.17.0) and the
# watchdog no longer aborting after sleep/wake. herdr subcommand and
# herdr-plugin/ verified present; the plugin is byte-identical to Herdr Lazy's
# lock. Requires the auto-update gate (`[update] auto_update = false` +
# CLAUTH_NO_UPDATE), otherwise the daemon reinstalls the herdr plugin at the
# latest tag every 30 min. Review: _planning/clauth-pin-review.md.
clauth git=https://github.com/uwuclxdy/clauth rev=df5410c6c51f878cef8a65e63936c79e5ad4740f

# ArtCraft headless CLIs + MCP servers (`<app>-cli mcp`), https://getartcraft.com/apps
#
# pdfcraft-cli and photocraft-cli ship as homebrew/core formulae and live in
# brew/Brewfile.70-media. The others exist only as GitHub release zips — no
# formula, not on crates.io (`publish = false`; the crates.io crate named
# `figcraft` is an unrelated project) — so they build from the workspace at the
# commit of their release tag. Bump rev= together with the cask version.
#
# Only figcraft is enabled. The rest mirror the casks disabled in
# brew/Brewfile.85-casks on 2026-10-20 (not usable yet): re-enable app and CLI
# together, after refreshing rev= to the then-current release tag.
figcraft-cli git=https://github.com/storytold/figcraft rev=47438dd4a2e8b49a7e6bb3dfd480262dadc37f12 # v0.7.0
# deckcraft-cli git=https://github.com/storytold/deckcraft rev=22db9261f9d1a214c296fd390173130c45d76d66 # v0.8.0
# filmcraft-cli git=https://github.com/storytold/filmcraft rev=4a69a038d32761f604b3c7e4845b21fb40b3cbe4 # v0.9.0
# gridcraft-cli git=https://github.com/storytold/gridcraft rev=a2cc4b42cac6e2c41bae71fba4607300755a0b47 # v0.9.0
# lightcraft-cli git=https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft rev=4f0b110bcbd2e350c6d97b47f1d824c2222295c4 # v0.9.1
# vectorcraft-cli git=https://github.com/storytold/vectorcraft rev=904f0fe5227bd987d55319e89a38b4b8f046998c # v0.13.1
# wordcraft-cli git=https://github.com/storytold/wordcraft rev=f2e15cf8f899a79899a2d9595ca4ce7df1e5ea22 # v0.8.0
